    "body": "Previously, Hazel treated strings as purely literal sequences of characters without interpreting escape sequences (e.g. \\n, \\t, \\\\). This PR introduces support for escape sequences in standard strings, while adding a new Raw String literal construct (r\"...\") that ignores escape codes and preserves all characters verbatim, similar to how standard strings acted previously.\r\n\r\nCloses #2379 ",
